  "_doc": "Shared by WPMediaVerse Free and Pro (Pro's .wbcom-i18n.json points here). Every translation uses these renderings for these terms; see docs/translation-standard.md in the wbcom-i18n-ai repo. Renderings follow the vocabulary WordPress, BuddyPress and media management platforms already use in each language. Change a rendering here, then run the tool with --review-all for that locale.",
